          104
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "In a Gu battle contest he offers Xiong Li a strength test: if Xiong Li can break free of his green vine binding, Qing Shu will admit defeat. Two vines climb from Qing Shu’s palms like green pythons and bind Xiong Li’s arms behind his back.",
        "chapters": [
          126
