  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In his garden arena, Gu Yue Qing Shu names Green Vine Gu while drilling attack forms beside Pine Needle Gu and Moonwhirl Gu. From his right palm a green vine about fifteen meters long shoots out; he grips it as a whip for splitting, coiling, and sweeping, hard enough to tear concrete from the stage floor.",
        "chapters": [
          104
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_gu_yue_qing_shu",
          "gu_pine_needle_gu",
          "gu_moonwhirl_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When Qing Shu becomes a tree-spirit embodiment through Wood Charm Gu, Green Vine Gu and Pine Needle Gu have their strength amplified.",
        "chapters": [
          126
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "wood-charm-amplification",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_wood_charm_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In the contest, after Wood Charm is in play, the vines darken from jade green to dark green, thicken, sprout wide leaves, regain broken lengths by regrowing, and raise their coiling strength by more than ten times, enough to hold a foe who has the strength of two bears.",
        "chapters": [
          126
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "wood-charm-amplification",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Qing Shu shoots green vines to coil around Gu Yue Yao Hong’s waist and pull her clear of Bai Ning Bing’s ice blade storm, but the storm still cuts her apart before the rescue finishes.",
        "chapters": [
          140
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fight-against-bai-ning-bing",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_gu_yue_yao_hong",
          "char_bai_ning_bing"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Under Wood Charm he deflects icicles with vines from both palms, then later sends hundreds of green vines at Bai Ning Bing like giant pythons. Those vines are several times faster than before and can press a water shield toward collapse. Green Vine Gu, Pin Needle Gu, and vitality grass are wood attribute Gu that show growth and gain power in tree-spirit form, while Moonwhirl Gu does not change that way.",
        "chapters": [
          141
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fight-against-bai-ning-bing",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Near death he forces Green Vine Gu again, sending thick vines through a wooden cage to trip and swarm Bai Ning Bing. He cannot keep producing more vines once the surrounding natural essence is almost fully absorbed; diluted essence still gathering in the air no longer meets Green Vine Gu’s needs.",
        "chapters": [
          142
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fight-against-bai-ning-bing",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
